  "prompt": "For each event_type, how many subscriptions have it as their latest recorded MRR change? recorded_at is Brussels local time, and every event counts, opening events included. Each subscription counts once, under the type of its change with the latest recorded_at. When two changes of a subscription tie on recorded_at, the lower event_id is kept. Return two columns, in this order: event_type and subscriptions. Return one row for each event_type that is some subscription's latest. Any row order is fine.",
